{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.knot_operator_selection","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.knot_operator_selection","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.Finset.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.not_knot_operator_selection_of_free_data","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.not_knot_operator_selection_of_free_data","kind":"theorem","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/knot_operator_selection.lean#L101-L113","doc":"**The claim is refutable at freely-chosen data**, which is why it is named\nrather than carried as a `sorry`.\n\nAt `nPartitions = 0`, `trPhi = 1`, `trPhiLambda = fun _ => 0`, conjunct (i)\nreads `1 = 0`. Recorded as a theorem so the module docstring's argument is\nchecked rather than asserted, and so a later attempt to \"finish\" this file by\nadding a `sorry` over free data fails against a standing counterexample. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.knot_operator_selection","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.knot_operator_selection","kind":"def","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/knot_operator_selection.lean#L78-L99","doc":"**The claim of `prop:knot-operator-selection`**, as a proposition over\ncaller-supplied data.\n\n* `trPhi = Σ_{λ < nPartitions} trPhiLambda λ` — (i) spectral decomposition;\n* `actionPair = channelSum` — (ii) multi-channel pair production;\n* `pairingKernelDim = 0` — (iii) Frobenius non-degeneracy;\n* `actionPhi ≤ actionAlt Φ_alt` for every on-shell `Φ_alt` — (iv)\n  minimum-action selection.\n\n**Named, not asserted.** See the module docstring for why neither a projection\nnor a `sorry` is the honest form here. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:knot-operator-selection","label":"prop:knot-operator-selection","md":"quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/knot-operator-selection.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}